  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.4.1 fixes jsonParsed transaction decoding when an instruction's parsed field is a bare value instead of a { type, info } object (spl-memo returns the memo string) - the value is preserved on ParsedInstructionInfo.Info. Follows semantic versioning; while on 0.x, minor releases may carry breaking changes. Changelog: https://github.com/jecacs/SolSharp/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
